@startuml
title Future - Transaction Template 与 Idempotency DURABLE

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

participant "IdempotencyExecutor" as EXEC
participant "TransactionTemplate" as TX
database "Idempotency DB\n同业务分片" as IDEM
participant "BusinessService" as BIZ
database "Business DB\n同一 DataSource" as DB

== Tx-A：短事务抢占 ==
EXEC -> TX : requiresNew
TX -> IDEM : INSERT/claim PROCESSING
IDEM --> TX : ACQUIRED
TX --> EXEC : COMMIT

== Tx-B：业务 + SUCCESS 同事务 ==
EXEC -> TX : required(routeKey)
TX -> DB : BEGIN
TX -> BIZ : callback
BIZ -> DB : business writes
BIZ --> TX : result
TX -> IDEM : markSuccess(owner,version)\n复用同一 transaction-bound Connection
IDEM --> TX : UPDATED
TX -> DB : COMMIT
TX --> EXEC : success

== 失败路径 ==
EXEC -> TX : required(routeKey)
TX -> DB : BEGIN
TX -> BIZ : callback
BIZ --> TX : exception
TX -> DB : ROLLBACK
TX --> EXEC : exception
EXEC -> TX : requiresNew
TX -> IDEM : markFailed(owner,version)
TX --> EXEC : COMMIT

note bottom
V1.1 只提供 JdbcExecutionManager 扩展点；
真正 transaction-aware 实现留给 transaction-component。
end note

@enduml
